%9Setting:%9

    nick_mode_color_voice (string; default: empty; the Shellter default
    configuration sets %%Z79C0FF%%_)

%9Description:%9

    Sets the colour of the voice prefix (+) that $nickmode prints.

    The value is a format code, for example %%ZF59E0B%%_. An empty value
    leaves the prefix uncoloured.

%9See also:%9

    NICK_MODE_COLOR, NICKMODE
